{
  "about": "Frames that are not frames and the edges of the read loop: invalid JSON, a JSON array, unknown and missing types, ping, the golden taps (frames recorded before dispatch, clients numbered per session), a connection error, the hello race (a Python client still counted as an extension when the real one left), a meeting on a platform alias, the history request without storage cleanup, and the debug file.",
  "config": {"golden": true},
  "steps": [
